caption:
AI CEOs are trying to make AI safety seem like a buzzword and trend that needs to be suppressed. The fact that they’re feeling this way makes it all the more important this topic gets talked about. 

AI can have many positively impactful moments in our lives. But the current state of it has spiraled out of control in a way where without proper regulation, we’ll never end up seeing those benefits long-term. 

